APA beats top-line and bottom-line estimates; raises FY2026 production outlook
 	* APA press release [https://seekingalpha.com/filing/309916873] (APA [https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/APA]): Q2 Non-GAAP EPS of $1.89 beats by $0.70.
 	* Revenue of $2.37B (+8.7% Y/Y) beats by $140M.
 	* 
Reported production of approximately 410,000 barrels of oil equivalent (BOE [https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/BOE]) per day; adjusted production, which excludes Egypt noncontrolling interest and tax barrels, was 347,000 BOE per day and exceeded guidance; 
•Delivered U.S. oil production of 123,500 barrels of oil per day, 2,500 barrels of oil per day above guidance; 
•Generated $1.7 billion of net cash provided by operating activities, $738 million of free cash flow, and $1.8 billion of adjusted EBITDAX; returned $189 million to shareholders through dividends and share repurchases; 
